WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.668
(Crew talking on set)

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.294
(Violin music swells)

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:04.629
You're in sports casual.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:06.131
I'm in costume.

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.507
(Laughter)

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.050
-Do you work with Jackson Lamb?

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.385
-Yeah.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.845
-What’s he like?

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:15.056
(Violin sting)

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:17.100
It's quite exciting to come back

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.686
ready for more
in this season of Slow Horses.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:22.605
-Yeah, coming back was a real joy.

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.816
It was a delight
to see all the old faces.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.484
It becomes like it's a family.

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:27.610
-Yeah.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.571
-This is Soho.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:32.574
Well, where’s all the
prostitutes and the junkies?

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.575
-Soho’s changed.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.325
-Shut up Mike.

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:36.494
-Marcus.

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:39.330
-How would you characterize
Lamb and River’s relationship

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.707
throughout the course of the show?

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:43.960
-It's sort of tough love with...

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.005
...with River because I see potential.

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:48.673
Right, so what do I do then?

00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:51.760
-Piss off to the
job center for all I care.

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:53.595
-The way he is with everybody.

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:56.431
It's not malicious. It's not nasty.

00:00:56.431 --> 00:01:00.101
I've met people like that,
and so have you, that when they find

00:01:00.101 --> 00:01:03.021
someone they think is very good,
they’re particularly hard on them.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.066
-And they ride ‘em harder, don’t they?
-Like hell.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:06.524
-Yeah.

00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:08.443
I mean, where I come
from, if you take the piss

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:10.987
that much of someone,
that is a mark of respect.

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:13.448
-Absolutely.
-Genuine affection is the worst thing

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.492
you can do to another human being.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.618
(Laughter)

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:18.244
-If you uncovered the trail

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:21.247
that quickly, it couldn't
have been that well hidden.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:22.791
Thanks.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.752
(Crunching)

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:28.088
-I've learned
a ridiculous amount from you.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.465
-You have?
-A ridiculous amount.

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:33.176
-One of my favorite
things was, as an actor,

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:36.054
watching you work the scene out
and get halfway through and go,

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:39.474
“Nah, that doesn't work”
and not lose the head.

00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:41.476
Be like,
“I'll find it at some point.”

00:01:41.684 --> 00:01:42.143
-Yeah.

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:44.604
Like people should sell tickets
to that kind of stuff.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.897
-Action!

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:48.358
-I'm very impressed

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:51.069
by how confident you are.

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:54.656
Even if I know it
all might be...

00:01:54.656 --> 00:01:55.240
-It’s bollocks.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.282
-An act,
-Yeah.

00:01:56.282 --> 00:02:01.287
-You appear to be
confident and relaxed.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.331
-You're right, he's definitely onto me.

00:02:03.331 --> 00:02:04.666
-Are you sure?

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:05.750
-Yeah.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.043
-You‘ll want to get closer.

00:02:08.503 --> 00:02:12.590
This season is,
in part, a revenge story.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:13.550
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:15.927
And it's gonna work. Gangbusters.
-Right.

00:02:15.927 --> 00:02:18.471
Although, we
shouldn't give too much away.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.974
-He was following
someone when he died.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.976
Maybe he saw something
that he shouldn't have.

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:25.186
-And, why has Slough House
been dragged into this?

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:26.396
We’re nobodies.

